<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Home Assistant 贡献者 blog: Frontend</title><description>News for contributors to Frontend.</description><link>https://www.hasscn.top/</link><item><title>2026.12 前端组件更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/25/frontend-component-updates-2026.12/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/25/frontend-component-updates-2026.12/</guid><description>ha-list、ha-list-item、ha-check-list-item 和 ha-radio-list-item 已被移除，因此前端不再使用 Material Web Components。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>仪表盘卡片可以以 ZIP 文件形式发布</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/24/dashboard-cards-zip-files/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/24/dashboard-cards-zip-files/</guid><description>从 Home Assistant 2026.12 开始，Marketplace 可以从一个 ZIP 文件安装仪表盘卡片。如何发布这样的文件，以及为什么目前需要保留一个备用方案。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>marketplace</category><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>在任何网页上展示实时仪表盘演示</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/06/live-dashboard-demos-on-any-page/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/06/live-dashboard-demos-on-any-page/</guid><description>Home Assistant 演示现在发布了一些元素，可以将真实的卡片、分区、视图和整个仪表盘放到任何网页上，并在浏览器中针对模拟后端运行。</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>仪表盘编辑器中的自定义分区策略</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/10/28/custom-section-strategies-in-the-dashboard-editor/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/10/28/custom-section-strategies-in-the-dashboard-editor/</guid><description>自 Home Assistant 2026.11 起，可以注册自定义分区策略，用户可从仪表盘编辑器中添加它们，并带有实时预览。</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>2026.11 前端组件更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/10/28/frontend-component-updates-2026.11/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/10/28/frontend-component-updates-2026.11/</guid><description>ha-md-list 和 ha-md-list-item 已被移除，主题现在可以为每个面板设置背景。</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>Home Assistant 内的 Python 控制台</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/10/17/debug-console/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/10/17/debug-console/</guid><description>全新的调试控制台可在运行中的 Home Assistant 内执行 Python，并随时调用 hass。了解如何启用它以及它的功能。</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>core</category><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>2026.8 前端组件更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/07/31/frontend-component-updates-2026.8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/07/31/frontend-component-updates-2026.8/</guid><description>我们新增了 ha-split-panel，这是 Web Awesome 分屏组件的 Home Assistant 封装。</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>2026.7 版本前端组件更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/06/23/frontend-component-updates-2026.7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/06/23/frontend-component-updates-2026.7/</guid><description>ha-button、ha-button-toggle-group 和 ha-slider 现使用简短的 Web Awesome 尺寸名称。</description><pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>卡片选择器中的自定义卡片建议</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/27/custom-card-suggestions/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/27/custom-card-suggestions/</guid><description>自 Home Assistant 2026.6 起，自定义卡片可以作为建议显示在卡片选择器中。</description><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>2026.6 前端组件更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/27/frontend-component-updates-2026.6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/27/frontend-component-updates-2026.6/</guid><description>ha-radio 已从我们的代码库中移除，我们现在使用基于 webawesome 的 ha-radio-group 和 ha-radio-option。</description><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>在自定义卡片中格式化实体名称</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/11/format-entity-name-helper/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/11/format-entity-name-helper/</guid><description>自 Home Assistant 2026.4 起，hass 对象提供了一个 formatEntityName 辅助函数。它与内置卡片（磁贴卡片、实体行等）使用的函数相同，用于根据实体的注册表上下文（实体、设备、区域、楼层）计算实体的显示名称。</description><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>2026.5 前端组件更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/04/frontend-component-updates-2026.5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/04/frontend-component-updates-2026.5/</guid><description>一个新组件替换了我们代码库中的 mwc-progress-bar，并且完全支持主题化。</description><pubDate>Mon, 04 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>前端上下文组、新的上下文装饰器以及弃用的上下文</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/04/frontend-context-groups-decorators/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/05/04/frontend-context-groups-decorators/</guid><description>在上一个版本中，我们引入了惰性上下文（lazy context），并且希望更多地使用 hass 上下文和惰性上下文，以替代直接传递 hass 对象。</description><pubDate>Mon, 04 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>注册自定义仪表盘策略</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/04/21/registering-custom-dashboard-strategies/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/04/21/registering-custom-dashboard-strategies/</guid><description>自 Home Assistant 2026.5 起，你现在可以注册自定义仪表盘策略，就像注册自定义卡片一样，这使得通过“社区仪表盘”部分下的新仪表盘对话框来发现并添加它们变得更加容易。</description><pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>前端组件更新 2026.4</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/03/25/frontend-component-updates-2026.4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/03/25/frontend-component-updates-2026.4/</guid><description>我们持续将基于 Material Design 的组件迁移到基于 Web Awesome 的组件。这次我们迁移了输入组件，这带来了 API 变更，但外观和体验暂时保持不变。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Mar 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>前端实现对话框的新方式</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/03/25/frontend-dialogs/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/03/25/frontend-dialogs/</guid><description>由对话框管理器管理的每个对话框只会被打开一次，并在应用程序的整个生命周期中保留在 DOM 中。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Mar 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>前端懒加载上下文</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/03/25/frontend-lazy-context/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/03/25/frontend-lazy-context/</guid><description>在 Home Assistant 前端中，上下文（Context）是一种在组件树中共享数据的方式，无需将其作为属性显式地逐层传递。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Mar 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>分区视图中自定义卡片的尺寸支持</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2024/11/06/custom-card-sections-support/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2024/11/06/custom-card-sections-support/</guid><description>在 Home Assistant 2024.11 中，构建仪表盘时“分区”视图现已成为默认视图。</description><pubDate>Wed, 06 Nov 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>ha-state-icon 的属性变更</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2024/01/30/ha-state-icon-properties-changes/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2024/01/30/ha-state-icon-properties-changes/</guid><description>在 Home Assistant 2024.2 中，集成（integration）有了一种提供图标的新方式。为支持这一新功能，ha-state-icon 组件的属性发生了变化。</description><pubDate>Tue, 30 Jan 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>自定义卡片的动作事件</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2023/07/07/action-event-custom-cards/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2023/07/07/action-event-custom-cards/</guid><description>在 Home Assistant Core 2023.7 版本中，我们为自定义卡片引入了 hass-action。</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Jul 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>弃用 Polymer</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2023/04/04/deprecating_polymer/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2023/04/04/deprecating_polymer/</guid><description>Home Assistant 前端曾使用 Polymer 库来构建其 Web 组件。</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Apr 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>实体状态颜色变更</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2022/12/07/entity-color-changes/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2022/12/07/entity-color-changes/</guid><description>从 Home Assistant Core 2022.12 版本开始，当实体处于活动状态时，我们为每个域使用不同的颜色。</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Dec 2022 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>升级到 Lit 2.0</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2021/05/19/lit-2.0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2021/05/19/lit-2.0/</guid><description>我们将前端升级为使用 Lit 2.0，这是 LitElement（3.0）和 lit-html（2.0）的一次重大版本升级，二者今后将以 Lit 之名共同发展。</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 May 2021 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>更多信息控件的懒加载</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/10/02/lazyMoreInfo/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/10/02/lazyMoreInfo/</guid><description>在 0.115 中，我们将更多信息控件改为懒加载。这样做是因为更多信息对话框总是在页面加载的早期阶段就被加载。</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>Lovelace：自定义视图布局</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/09/30/customViewChanges/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/09/30/customViewChanges/</guid><description>Custom Element 开发者现在可以创建自定义视图布局（Custom View Layouts），供用户加载和使用！</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>Lovelace：getCardSize 现在支持异步了</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/06/01/getCardSize/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/06/01/getCardSize/</guid><description>自从我们在 Lovelace 中引入卡片懒加载（lazy loading）以来，获取懒加载卡片的卡片尺寸一直很困难。</description><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>自定义图标集</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/05/09/custom-iconsets/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/05/09/custom-iconsets/</guid><description>如果你是某个自定义图标集（custom icon set）的维护者，可能需要对其进行更新。</description><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>自定义 Lovelace 的翻译</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/04/23/frontend-translations/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/04/23/frontend-translations/</guid><description>如果您是自定义 Lovelace 卡片的作者并使用了翻译，请注意，状态翻译的键已经发生了变化。</description><pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>可能影响 0.106 中自定义卡片的变更</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/02/18/106-custom-card-changes/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/02/18/106-custom-card-changes/</guid><description>我们在 Home Assistant Core 0.106 中进行了一些可能会影响自定义 Lovelace 卡片的更改。如果您是自定义卡片开发者，请阅读以下内容。</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Feb 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>0.71：改进的自定义面板与自定义 UI 的细微变更</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2018/06/01/071-custom-panels/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2018/06/01/071-custom-panels/</guid><description>前端现代化和本地化的工作正在全速推进。这篇博文将介绍 Home Assistant 0.71 即将推出的新功能，该版本应于今日进入 beta 渠道，并计划于一周后正式发布。</description><pubDate>Fri, 01 Jun 2018 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>自定义 UI 和自定义面板的更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2018/05/22/custom-ui-panels-api/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2018/05/22/custom-ui-panels-api/</guid><description>随着 Home Assistant 0.70 的发布，我们将前端的构建流水线从基于 HTML 导入迁移到了 ES 模块导入（稍后会详细介绍）。</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 May 2018 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>frontend</category></item></channel></rss>